08:48.200 --> 08:49.370
Yunxiao.

08:51.870 --> 08:53.060
Yunxiao.

08:56.750 --> 08:58.220
Yunxiao.

08:59.440 --> 09:00.940
Kenapa awak di sini?

09:02.440 --> 09:03.610
Biar saya beritahu awak,

09:03.910 --> 09:06.060
