09:15.030 --> 09:16.940
Selamat petang, Yunxiao.

09:17.720 --> 09:18.730
Baiklah, saya...

09:18.960 --> 09:20.610
Istana Naga itu sangat besar.

09:20.630 --> 09:21.820
